<title>USA: Bell Milgray purchase clears FTC.</title>
<headline>Bell Milgray purchase clears FTC.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Industries Inc said its proposed $100 million acquisition of Milgray Electronics Inc has cleared the antitrust review of the Federal Trade Commission.</p>
<p>Bell announced last month it planned to acquire Milgray for $14.77 per share. The deal is conditioned on several factors, including the tender of at least two-thirds of Milgray's shares. The tender offer expires on January 7.</p>
</text>
